"Able to state the objectives but not relate to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to provide and explain the objectives with regards to project background, problem statements, and project scope.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Literature Review\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Poor review on background, tools, methodology or similar works.\",\"Adequate review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\",\"Comprehensive review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\",\"Very comprehensive review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Citations\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Citations are insufficient or incorrectly used within body of the thesis and reference list.\",\"Some citing mistakes are made within body of the thesis and reference list.\",\"Citations are clearly identified, however, there may have been minor errors, conventions and format are used.\",\"All reference materials are clearly identified and correctly cited in both the body of the text and the reference section.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Chosen Methodology\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Selection of methodology is not suitable and proves very little knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is not very suitable and proves adequate knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is sufficient and proves good knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is very suitable and proves excellent knowledge in implementing the project.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Implementation\\/Design Details\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were not supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\",\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experimen