weight\":12.5,\"evaluators\":[\"s\",\"m\"],\"compilation\":\"\"}},\"presentation\":[{\"item\":\"Overall Delivery\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Presentation lack of structure, background not properly introduced, and proposed solution does not seem to be linked.\",\"Presentation organization seems adequate although linkage between background of project with proposed solution is unclear.\",\"Clear organizational pattern. Smooth presentation where background of project is explained together with acceptable solution.\",\"Professionally-structured. Very smooth presentation where background of project is explained clearly before going into very innovative solution.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Communication Skill\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Poor body language, gestures, pace\\/speed, pitch, slide arrangement and\\/or enunciation.\",\"Good body language and gestures but poor on pace\\/speed, slide arrangement, pitch\\/enunciation.\",\"Good body language, gestures, pitch, slide arrangement and\\/or enunciation but not at correct pace\\/speed.\",\"Excellent body language, gestures, pace\\/speed, pitch, slide arrangement and\\/or enunciation.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Objectives Presentment\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":2,\"levels\":[\"Does not give relevance objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to give limited information on objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to state the objectives but not relate to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to provide and explain the objectives with regards to project background, problem statements, and project scope.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Review Justification\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"Does not give sufficient information that relates to the research topic or without proper citation.\",\"Able to give limited information on statement related to research topic using sentences directly from the sources.\",\"Able to state the problem but somewhat unable to relate the problem to research topic using own words.\",\"Able to relate problem statement to project using extensive information from various sources using own sentences in presentation.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Methodology Clarification\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Unable to explain the experimental design, procedure and suitable analysis method.\",\"Able to explain experimental design procedure but unable to justify the selection of suitable analysis method.\",\"Able to elaborate design and experimental procedure but does not clearly justify the selection of analysis method.\",\"Able to elaborate design and procedures of experiment and justify the selection of suitable analysis method.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Q & A\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Able to partially answer and defend project findings but unable to project background and scope.\",\"Able to answer and defend project findings and have difficulty to relate with project background and scope.\",\"Confidence in answering and defending project finding based on the understanding to project background and scope.\",\"Clearly and precisely answers and defends project findings based on understanding to project background and scope.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Project Schedule\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":2,\"levels\":[\"Gives a Gantt chart with limited details.\",\"Gives a Gantt chart with limited information regarding work breakdown structure and visualizes tasks on a timeline.\",\"Gives and describes Gantt chart regarding work breakdown structure with sufficient scope of work, and visualizes specific tasks on a timeline.\",\"Gives and describes Gantt chart regarding work breakdown structure with the scope of work, and visualizes all tasks on a timeline, showing their start and finish dates, dependencies between them and other information.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0}],\"project_outcome\":[{\"item\":\"Innovative Value\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"Proposed project exists abundantly or did not relate to the introduced problem.\",\"Proposed project is not new, and quite beneficial to the introduced problem.\",\"Proposed project is not new but beneficial and less applied to the introduced problem.\",\"Proposed project is very innovative, significantly beneficial and applicable to the introduced problem.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Tech Stack\\/Tools Application\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are not justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are adequately justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are excellently justified\\/suitable.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Preliminary Implementation\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"No preliminary UI\\/experiments have been conducted.\",\"Poor preliminary UI\\/experiments have been designed\\/conducted.\",\"Sufficient preliminary UI\\/experiments have been partially designed\\/conducted.\",\"UI\\/experiments have been partially designed\\/conducted. Some preliminary results have been obtained\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Time Management\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' poor management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' sufficient management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' good management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' excellent management of time in conducting it.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"End Product Demo\\/Delivery\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":2.5,\"levels\":[\"No final outcome of FYP1 that has a solid existence to be delivered\\/presented, only theory\\/process idea.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has a slight existence to be delivered\\/presented.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has little existence to be delivered\\/presented.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has a solid existence\\/prototype to be delivered\\/presented.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0}],\"justification\":\"\",\"general_comments\":\"\",\"sv_evaluation\":[{\"item\":\"Progress 1 Skills in Identifying Problem Statement, Objectives, Scope\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Student put no own effort and work in defining the proposed project and finalise it only with supervision.\",\"Student put less own effort and work in defining the proposed project and need supervision.\",\"Student put adequate own effort and work in defining the proposed project with supervision.\",\"Student put maximal own effort and work in defining the proposed project with minimal supervision.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Progress 2 Skills in Reviewing Literature\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Student cannot conduct adequate review and took very long time.\",\"Student conducted adequate review with maximum guidance on the process.\",\"Student conducted review with guidance and came out with good review.\",\"Student conducted review with minimum guidance and came out with comprehensive review.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Progress 3 Skills in exploring methods and tools\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Student did not implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\",\"Student can sufficiently implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\",\"Student can nicely implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\",\"Student can excellently implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Progress 4 Final Thesis Preparation\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Final thesis submission was last minute for supervisor revision with major mistakes (formatting, organization, major correction).\",\"Final thesis submission was adequately proper for supervisor to revise with several mistakes in preparation.\",\"Final thesis submission was proper for supervisor to revise with good preparation.\",\"Final thesis submission was at proper time for supervisor revision with very good preparation (format, organization, very little correction).\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Overall Initiative & Independence\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Passive; waits for supervisor to dictate every action.\",\"Limited initiative; depends heavily on supervisor for next steps.\",\"Demonstrates initiative with occasional reliance on supervisor\\u2019s direction.\",\"Highly self-motivated; takes initiative in exploring solutions; shows ownership of project.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Overall Approach to Planning\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Little to no effort. Poor attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\",\"Adequate effort. Several lacking in attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\",\"Less organised, good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation, but sometimes require reminders.\",\"Highly organised and on track. Very good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0}],\"report\":[{\"item\":\"Content Organization\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Content is not arranged logically.\",\"Content is somewhat arranged logically with weak links.\",\"Content is arranged logically and they are usually clearly linked.\",\"Content is organized logically with strong link between units.\"],\"comments\":\"AS\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Formatting\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Formatting has major mistake.\",\"Formatting has minor mistake.\",\"Formatting has minimal mistake.\",\"No formatting mistake.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Background, Objectives, & Scope\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"Does not give relevance objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to give limited information on objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to state the objectives but not relate to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to provide and explain the objectives with regards to project background, problem statements, and project scope.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Literature Review\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Poor review on background, tools, methodology or similar works.\",\"Adequate review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\",\"Comprehensive review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\",\"Very comprehensive review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Citations\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Citations are insufficient or incorrectly used within body of the thesis and reference list.\",\"Some citing mistakes are made within body of the thesis and reference list.\",\"Citations are clearly identified, however, there may have been minor errors, conventions and format are used.\",\"All reference materials are clearly identified and correctly cited in both the body of the text and the reference section.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Chosen Methodology\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Selection of methodology is not suitable and proves very little knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is not very suitable and proves adequate knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is sufficient and proves good knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is very suitable and proves excellent knowledge in implementing the project.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Implementation\\/Design Details\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were not supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\",\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were partly supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\",\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\",\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were strongly supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Gantt Chart\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Project activities and milestones are not described.\",\"Project activities and milestones are partially described.\",\"Project activities and milestones are generally described.\",\"Project activities and milestones are clearly described.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"References\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"Reference list has incorrect references order, incomplete reference information, incorrect identification of sources, and various mistakes.\",\"Reference list has incorrect references order, incomplete reference information, incorrect identification of sources, and various mistakes.\",\"Reference list has correct reference order, complete reference information, and only minor mistakes such as a misplaced period.\",\"All cited sources on the reference list has no mistakes and can be found.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0}],\"totals\":{\"presentation_S\":\"0.00\",\"presentation_M\":\"0.00\",\"presentation_total\":\"0.00\",\"project_outcome_S\":\"0.00\",\"project_outcome_M\":\"0.00\",\"project_outcome_total\":\"0.00\",\"sv_evaluation_S\":\"0.00\",\"sv_evaluation_total\":\"0.00\",\"report_S\":\"0.00\",\"report_M\":\"0.00\",\"report_